WEBVTT

00:32:28.746 --> 00:32:31.788
We need to understand how to
overcome this ingroup bias

00:32:31.996 --> 00:32:36.413
and broaden people's circles of concern
to motivate them to care about helping

00:32:36.413 --> 00:32:38.246
those who have been most disadvantaged.

00:32:39.079 --> 00:32:40.704
Dismantling these biases is

00:32:40.704 --> 00:32:45.288
so important that we'll be devoting two
episodes to it this season. Stay tuned.

00:32:53.454 --> 00:32:56.329
When you hit turbulence, it can be
hard to see the way forward,

00:32:57.204 --> 00:32:58.579
it can help to look backward.

00:32:59.246 --> 00:33:00.871
What we see when we do that is that